<title>CHINA: China Feb industrial production up 10 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>China Feb industrial production up 10 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's industrial production rose to 126 billion yuan ($15.2 billion) in February, a rise of roughly 10 percent compared with the same period last year, the China Securities newspaper reported on Friday.</p>
<p>It said the figures were provided by the Economic Information Centre of the State Economic and Trade Commission.</p>
<p>($1 = 8.3 yuan)</p>
</text>
